'''Messier''' (メシエ, ''Meshie'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Messier
|image = E 507.png
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
|appearance = [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
Messier has very low range, but her Omni Strike hits up to 600 and strengthens by 200% at 20% health. This combined with her great damage, high durability and the nasty support makes her more than a match to any player. Her main weaknesses are her unusually high knockback count, somewhat slow attack rate and an easy to exploit trait.

